      "side": 1,
      "message": "`clear_job_queue` only deletes jobs; it does not clear pending BIOS attributes. When the queue is already empty and the pending BootMode still blocks a set (the SYS011 state Dell documents with an empty queue), this returns True without clearing anything, the re-read at line 426 still mismatches, and the rebuild aborts. The Settings resource exposes `Actions/Oem/DellManager.ClearPending`; calling that when the queue is empty would cover the state this retry cannot recover.",
